  {
   "id": "how-2-escape-237741@post-2023-09-05",
   "gameId": "how-2-escape-237741",
   "displayName": "Patch Note - 09/05/23",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "inferred",
   "announcedAt": "2023-09-05T10:23:56.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "First of all, thanks a lot to @everyone who bought the game and we hope you love it!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We are a small development team and it's our first game on Steam so if you like How 2 Escape and want to help us, we'll be happy if you could write a positive review on Steam! It seems nothing but it really helps us a lot! ♥",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "There is no obligation doing that, but it really can help us so if you can, we will be thrilled!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Let's get to the bug fix",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Bunk and Lounge : We fixed the error in which zooming into tickets or pages would make them disappear.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Desk - Books : fixed the bug which occured when you switched the last book of the library resulting in the incapacity of putting back the book.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Kitchen : Fruits can't be stuck in the sink anymore.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Desk : Slides can't be stuck in the desk anymore.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Localization improvements : mostly chinese, but we've reworked a bit the hint system. Don't forget to SEND the clue by message to your contact in the companion app! The ticket with only one word is the keyword to get the real \"clue\" from player 2.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "BreakFirst & Just For Games teams!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
